    "Create your own API application at strava.com/settings/api (free), set the callback domain to `localhost`, then paste the Client ID and Secret here. Requests the `activity:read_all` scope so private activities sync too.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Създай собствено API приложение на strava.com/settings/api (безплатно), задай callback домейн `localhost` и постави Client ID и Secret тук. Иска обхват `activity:read_all`, за да се синхронизират и частните активности."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lege unter strava.com/settings/api eine eigene API-Anwendung an (kostenlos), setze die Callback-Domain auf `localhost` und füge Client-ID und Secret hier ein. Fordert den Bereich `activity:read_all` an, damit auch private Aktivitäten synchronisiert werden."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea tu propia aplicación de API en strava.com/settings/api (gratis), pon `localhost` como dominio de callback y pega aquí el Client ID y el Secret. Solicita el permiso `activity:read_all` para que también se sincronicen las actividades privadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crée ta propre application d'API sur strava.com/settings/api (gratuit), mets `localhost` comme domaine de callback, puis colle ici le Client ID et le Secret. Demande la portée `activity:read_all` pour que les activités privées se synchronisent aussi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
